  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A plain ring of grey Numenorean silver, too big for most hands, with the seven stars and the white tree worn almost flat by other people's thumbs. It is not an heirloom -- Erendis of Annuminas keeps a box of them, and gives one to every sorcerer who comes past her fire and lets her name what woke in them. It is a receipt. It says: somebody knows what you are, and did not run."
    }
  },
